-- Matrices over a commutative ring indexed by finite sets: entrywise
-- operations, products, matrix–vector products and the dot product,
-- transpose and conjugate transpose for an involution of the ring,
-- diagonal, scalar, and single-entry matrices, the trace, entrywise images
-- under a ring map, submatrices and reindexing, block matrices
-- (fromBlocks, fromRows, fromCols, toBlocks), block-triangular and
-- hermitian matrices, the ring of square matrices on any finite index
-- set (agreeing with Cumulus's matrixRing on n = {0, …, n − 1}), the
-- matrix module, matrices as linear maps (Matrix.toLin') and the matrix
-- of a linear map in bases (LinearMap.toMatrix).
-- Part of the GRH blueprint.
-- Planned home: LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Basic.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
